Source: mixtapes
Section: sound
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Ackerman-00 <noreply@example.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), cargo, rustc, cmake, make, pkg-config, gcc, g++,
 libglib2.0-dev, libgtk-4-dev (>= 4.18), libadwaita-1-dev (>= 1.8),
 libwebkitgtk-6.0-dev (>= 2.44), libjavascriptcoregtk-6.0-dev, libsoup-3.0-dev,
 libgstreamer1.0-dev (>= 1.24), libgstreamer-plugins-base1.0-dev,
 libsqlite3-dev (>= 3.34.1), libssl-dev, libgdk-pixbuf-2.0-dev,
 libpango1.0-dev, libgraphene-1.0-dev, desktop-file-utils
Standards-Version: 4.7.0
Rules-Requires-Root: no
Homepage: https://github.com/m-obeid/Mixtapes

Package: mixtapes
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends},
 yt-dlp, nodejs, gstreamer1.0-plugins-good,
 gstreamer1.0-plugins-bad, gstreamer1.0-libav, libgtk-4-1,
 libadwaita-1-0, libwebkitgtk-6.0-4, hicolor-icon-theme
Recommends: ffmpeg, xdg-desktop-portal, xdg-desktop-portal-gtk
Description: Cross-platform YouTube Music client (GTK4, Libadwaita, GStreamer)
 Mixtapes is a cross-platform desktop application for streaming
 YouTube Music, built with GTK4, Libadwaita and GStreamer. The codebase
 was rewritten from Python to Rust in October 2026.
